  [ 16] getlocal 0 .............................. <stop>
  [ 18] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 20] thebuiltin 4 ............................ <the ticks>
  [ 22] nteq .................................... <stop <> the ticks>
  [ 23] jmpifz [ 32] ............................ repeat while stop <> the ticks
  [ 26] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 28] extcall 34 .............................. nothing()
  [ 30] endrepeat [ 16]
  [ 32] ret
end
